 - Use the local environment at `.venv/Scripts/python.exe` on Windows. If it is missing, run `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/setup.ps1` from the project root. Do not rely on a globally installed `python` command.
 - For bulk procedural assets, edit `recipes/starter.json` or add a recipe, then run `.venv/Scripts/pixel-assets.exe <recipe> --out <build-directory>`. Keep separate output directories for distinct recipes.
 - Keep shipped/source artwork under `assets/`; `build/` is generated and ignored. Never overwrite an existing art asset unless the user requests replacement; use a new name or version.
